{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}About · ScarfieTextbooks{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <article class="about-page">
        <p class="about-notice" role="note">We’ve upgraded the site’s infrastructure. If anything isn’t working as it should, please <a href="#contact">contact the site admins</a>.</p>

        <h1>About ScarfieTextbooks</h1>
        <p>A free noticeboard for students buying, selling or looking for textbooks and other student essentials. No listing fees or commission.</p>

        <h2>Post now for next year</h2>
        <p>Listings default to a year online. Choose an earlier hide date if you like. Post a book in November and someone starting their course next July can still find it. There’s no need to keep bumping it.</p>
        <p>Mark it sold or archive it when you’re done. Change the hide date on your listing’s edit page whenever you need, up to a year from today. We’ll email you near expiry.</p>

        <h2>Selling or looking?</h2>
        <p><a href="{{ path('app_listing_new') }}">Sell an item</a> with its price, condition and photos, or <a href="{{ path('app_listing_new', {type: 'wanted'}) }}">post a wanted listing</a> with your budget and requirements. ISBN lookup is an optional way to fill in textbook details.</p>

        <h2>Contact and collection</h2>
        <p>Messages go to the seller’s inbox and email. Replies happen by email; phone numbers appear only when a seller chooses to share one. Arrange collection and payment directly with each other. The site doesn’t process payments or deliveries.</p>

        <h2>Accounts and photos</h2>
        <p>You need an account to post. Confirm your email to make your listing photos visible to others. Uploaded photos have location metadata removed. Books without a photo may show a cover from <a href="https://openlibrary.org/">Open Library</a>.</p>

        <h2 id="contact">Contact us</h2>
        <p>Found a problem or have a question? Send the site admins a message and we’ll reply by email.</p>
        {{ form_start(contact, {attr: {class: 'about-contact', novalidate: 'novalidate'}}) }}
            <div class="form-grid">
                <div class="form-field">{{ form_row(contact.name) }}</div>
                <div class="form-field">{{ form_row(contact.email) }}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">{{ form_row(contact.body) }}</div>
            {{ form_row(contact.website) }}
            {% if contact.children.captcha is defined %}<div class="form-field">{{ form_row(contact.captcha) }}</div>{% endif %}
            <button class="button" type="submit">Send message</button>
        {{ form_end(contact) }}
    </article>
{% endblock %}
